WEBVTT

1
00:00:25.692 --> 00:00:27.819
<i>I'm so agile.</i>

2
00:00:32.657 --> 00:00:34.868
<i>I've tried so hard
to get this second life.</i>

3
00:00:34.951 --> 00:00:36.703
<i>I can't succumb to fear.</i>

4
00:00:38.038 --> 00:00:39.789
I can't die like this!

5
00:00:44.461 --> 00:00:47.505
<i>Is it because my strength ability
has improved?</i>

6
00:00:49.883 --> 00:00:52.218
<i>But... It's still stronger than me.</i>

7
00:00:56.264 --> 00:00:57.682
<i>No. my attacks don't work.</i>

8
00:01:05.690 --> 00:01:07.192
{\an8}<i>What should I do?</i>

9
00:02:47.876 --> 00:02:49.168
<i>It's too difficult alone.</i>

10
00:02:52.839 --> 00:02:54.966
<i>There are no teammates or healers.</i>

11
00:02:55.550 --> 00:02:57.176
<i>All I have is water and food.</i>

12
00:02:58.928 --> 00:03:00.305
<i>If this goes on...</i>

13
00:03:01.931 --> 00:03:04.142
<i>If only I had a weapon with magic power...</i>

14
00:03:04.225 --> 00:03:05.393
<i>Weapon?</i>

15
00:03:05.476 --> 00:03:06.728
Inventory!

16
00:03:22.577 --> 00:03:24.996
Though I don't know why
this is in my inventory.

17
00:03:27.165 --> 00:03:30.084
Mr. Kim said this sword
cost him three million.

18
00:03:31.002 --> 00:03:32.795
It's beyond my wildest dreams.

19
00:03:33.671 --> 00:03:35.006
I can't think about that now.

20
00:03:35.089 --> 00:03:36.341
I'll just use it.

21
00:03:37.342 --> 00:03:38.676
My body stopped hurting.

22
00:03:41.930 --> 00:03:43.264
As long as I have a weapon.

23
00:03:43.890 --> 00:03:45.058
there's nothing to fear.

24
00:03:48.811 --> 00:03:50.730
What? The sword won't come out!

25
00:03:53.024 --> 00:03:54.776
Please. come out!

26
00:04:04.410 --> 00:04:06.454
Your steel fangs seem genuine.

27
00:04:07.747 --> 00:04:09.540
I finally got this sword.

28
00:04:10.875 --> 00:04:13.002
Don't even try to damage it!

29
00:04:18.758 --> 00:04:20.009
Upon closer inspection...

30
00:04:21.094 --> 00:04:22.553
<i>Compared to those things.</i>

31
00:04:23.721 --> 00:04:25.014
these beasts are nothing.

32
00:04:42.073 --> 00:04:44.409
Eh. I'm level 2 now.

33
00:04:44.909 --> 00:04:47.495
I never leveled up
when I completed daily quests.

34
00:04:48.037 --> 00:04:50.748
I see. because this is actual combat.

35
00:04:50.832 --> 00:04:52.750
My wounds just healed also because...

36
00:04:53.334 --> 00:04:57.297
If I level up. all my abilities
will increase by one point?

37
00:04:58.006 --> 00:04:59.799
A total of five points.

38
00:04:59.882 --> 00:05:01.926
I only get three points from daily quests.

39
00:05:02.010 --> 00:05:04.512
So leveling up through combat is faster.

40
00:05:05.346 --> 00:05:09.017
How much will my abilities grow
with each point increase?

41
00:05:09.100 --> 00:05:11.686
Even intelligence and perception
have been quantified.

42
00:05:12.812 --> 00:05:14.689
Strength is the easiest to understand.

43
00:05:14.772 --> 00:05:16.774
With only 32 points.

44
00:05:16.858 --> 00:05:18.693
my movements became much lighter.

45
00:05:19.777 --> 00:05:21.237
I'm only guessing.

46
00:05:21.321 --> 00:05:23.740
But I think the higher the basic ability.

47
00:05:23.823 --> 00:05:26.451
the more points I'll be able to get.

48
00:05:28.244 --> 00:05:31.205
So... I really can become stronger.

49
00:05:34.292 --> 00:05:36.919
But they are just five small magic beasts.

50
00:05:37.003 --> 00:05:38.546
I may have got carried away.

51
00:05:40.590 --> 00:05:43.801
They have no magic gems on them?

52
00:05:46.554 --> 00:05:49.515
I have got an item instead of a magic gem?

53
00:05:50.558 --> 00:05:52.727
<i>Strange things are happening to me.</i>

54
00:05:53.519 --> 00:05:56.522
<i>If I am controlled
by a system like a game.</i>

55
00:05:57.065 --> 00:06:01.194
<i>will this dungeon and magic beasts
differ from the ones in reality?</i>

56
00:06:02.862 --> 00:06:04.655
Ah. I found the shop.

57
00:06:05.364 --> 00:06:06.199
Purchase.

58
00:06:07.325 --> 00:06:09.827
New players can't use it?

59
00:06:10.703 --> 00:06:11.579
Sell.

60
00:06:16.375 --> 00:06:17.835
Twenty gold coins.

61
00:06:18.836 --> 00:06:21.214
How much would that be in cash?

62
00:06:22.173 --> 00:06:25.093
But this dungeon is at most E-rank.

63
00:06:25.176 --> 00:06:27.804
so 20 gold coins probably isn't much.

64
00:06:29.180 --> 00:06:30.473
All right.

65
00:06:30.556 --> 00:06:31.766
What should I do now?

66
00:06:32.642 --> 00:06:34.894
I can't leave unless I defeat the boss.

67
00:06:35.436 --> 00:06:38.106
It seems I could leave
once I get the teleportation stone.

68
00:06:38.189 --> 00:06:40.316
but I have no idea where that is.

69
00:06:40.817 --> 00:06:43.027
If this drags on. I'll be short of food.

70
00:06:47.240 --> 00:06:48.699
Although it's an E-rank dungeon.

71
00:06:48.783 --> 00:06:50.993
it's still so hard for me
to defeat the boss alone.

72
00:06:51.786 --> 00:06:55.081
Wait... If I keep leveling up.
I might stand a chance.

73
00:06:57.416 --> 00:07:01.003
Although it's possible
that I'll be dead before that.

74
00:07:14.100 --> 00:07:15.601
There's nothing to be afraid of.

75
00:07:16.436 --> 00:07:18.646
I've died once after all.

76
00:07:35.371 --> 00:07:37.874
I won't die that easily.

77
00:07:38.791 --> 00:07:40.751
You don't die too quickly either.

78
00:07:43.129 --> 00:07:44.589
If I kill you in an instant.

79
00:07:45.214 --> 00:07:47.216
I'll feel really bad.

80
00:07:48.968 --> 00:07:51.137
You have qualified as a hunter.

81
00:07:53.055 --> 00:07:54.974
<i>Now I can pay mom's medical bills.</i>

82
00:07:55.057 --> 00:07:57.310
<i>If I could have another chance...</i>

83
00:08:00.354 --> 00:08:01.230
<i>Let's...</i>

84
00:08:02.190 --> 00:08:03.858
{\an8}<i>Let's have a fierce battle.</i>

85
00:08:09.572 --> 00:08:11.032
<i>As long as I'm alive.</i>

86
00:08:11.115 --> 00:08:12.700
<i>I'll fight to the last moment.</i>

87
00:08:14.035 --> 00:08:15.912
<i>As long as it makes me stronger...</i>

88
00:08:17.371 --> 00:08:20.082
<i>I can abide by any rules!</i>

89
00:08:29.884 --> 00:08:31.010
That doesn't look good.

90
00:08:31.511 --> 00:08:33.554
Can't the guild
come to deal with it quickly?

91
00:08:44.148 --> 00:08:46.567
This sword is almost done for.

92
00:08:48.110 --> 00:08:51.489
Weapons are just expendables after all.

93
00:08:52.240 --> 00:08:56.244
No matter what weapon I get. it will
wear out after a few times in the dungeon.

94
00:08:57.036 --> 00:09:00.039
However... It seems like the battle is over.

95
00:09:06.003 --> 00:09:07.838
Thirty-four wolf fangs.

96
00:09:08.381 --> 00:09:10.132
Two worn-out short swords.

97
00:09:10.216 --> 00:09:11.425
A traveler's attire.

98
00:09:12.426 --> 00:09:13.302
And...

99
00:09:13.928 --> 00:09:17.098
The teleportation stone
that's easier to get than I imagined.

100
00:09:18.391 --> 00:09:19.642
Should I return?

101
00:09:21.644 --> 00:09:22.895
But.

102
00:09:22.979 --> 00:09:26.440
perhaps there won't be a chance
to get stronger so easily again.

103
00:09:27.149 --> 00:09:30.027
What will happen to this dungeon
if I use the teleportation stone?

104
00:09:30.570 --> 00:09:31.529
Will it disappear?

105
00:09:32.488 --> 00:09:37.076
Like a time-limited event in a game?

106
00:09:38.452 --> 00:09:39.579
Regardless.

107
00:09:39.662 --> 00:09:42.707
it seems like I am being toyed
with by some unknown force.

108
00:09:44.166 --> 00:09:46.669
And I cannot escape.

109
00:09:49.463 --> 00:09:52.341
Should I continue forward or turn back?

110
00:10:08.441 --> 00:10:09.984
Yes. this is Lee Joohee.

111
00:10:11.027 --> 00:10:13.070
Ah. you're from the Hunter's Association.

112
00:10:13.654 --> 00:10:15.573
I'm really sorry about earlier.

113
00:10:18.409 --> 00:10:20.745
That gate had a Dungeon Break?

114
00:10:21.245 --> 00:10:22.788
Right around here?

115
00:10:23.581 --> 00:10:25.625
<i>It's all because I rejected him.</i>

116
00:10:25.708 --> 00:10:29.962
<i>We're currently assembling
available hunters to deal with it.</i>

117
00:10:30.046 --> 00:10:32.590
<i>But there's a serious shortage of healers.</i>

118
00:10:37.970 --> 00:10:39.305
I understand...

119
00:10:40.723 --> 00:10:42.725
{\an8}<i>With each level up.</i>

120
00:10:43.392 --> 00:10:46.646
{\an8}<i>my battles with magic beasts
become easier.</i>

121
00:10:55.738 --> 00:10:58.532
<i>The color denoting
the magic beast's name also changes.</i>

122
00:10:58.616 --> 00:11:01.369
<i>I guess white means it's weaker than me.</i>

123
00:11:01.452 --> 00:11:03.037
<i>Orange means it has the same level as me.</i>

124
00:11:03.829 --> 00:11:05.331
<i>And red means it's stronger than me.</i>

125
00:11:06.415 --> 00:11:08.834
<i>Lycan. which was initially marked red.</i>

126
00:11:08.918 --> 00:11:10.628
<i>is marked white now.</i>

127
00:11:11.379 --> 00:11:13.756
<i>This indicates I have become
much stronger.</i>

128
00:11:14.465 --> 00:11:15.841
<i>Even so...</i>

129
00:11:15.925 --> 00:11:19.178
<i>I still feel that I can't defeat
the one below with my current strength.</i>

130
00:11:19.762 --> 00:11:22.515
<i>I don't know if it's because
my perception has improved.</i>

131
00:11:23.015 --> 00:11:24.642
<i>I can clearly feel</i>

132
00:11:25.643 --> 00:11:27.478
<i>that the monster below</i>

133
00:11:28.062 --> 00:11:29.230
<i>is terrifying.</i>

134
00:11:31.941 --> 00:11:34.318
<i>It seems I can no longer level up here.</i>

135
00:11:35.277 --> 00:11:37.780
<i>If I keep fighting like this.
this sword probably won't hold up.</i>

136
00:11:50.459 --> 00:11:54.088
Are the stairs at this station so long?

137
00:12:08.644 --> 00:12:10.438
It no longer looks like a station.

138
00:12:17.486 --> 00:12:18.320
<i>So fast!</i>

139
00:12:23.242 --> 00:12:24.118
<i>The sword...</i>

140
00:12:30.082 --> 00:12:32.084
<i>I've leveled up a lot.</i>

141
00:12:32.918 --> 00:12:34.462
<i>but its name</i>

142
00:12:36.297 --> 00:12:37.173
<i>is still in orange.</i>

143
00:12:39.091 --> 00:12:41.218
You're the boss here. right?

144
00:12:42.136 --> 00:12:45.306
It's covered in scales.
This sword is useless against it.

145
00:12:45.806 --> 00:12:47.641
Going bare-handed will be worse.

146
00:12:58.110 --> 00:13:00.488
<i>Its attacks are fast and heavy.</i>

147
00:13:00.988 --> 00:13:03.032
<i>I can only try
to weaken its defense first.</i>

148
00:13:03.532 --> 00:13:06.076
<i>But how can I pierce through
these thick scales?</i>

149
00:13:14.418 --> 00:13:16.086
<i>If I took this hit head-on.</i>

150
00:13:16.170 --> 00:13:17.004
<i>I would be dead.</i>

151
00:13:37.525 --> 00:13:40.194
{\an8}<i>I thought I had become a bit stronger...</i>

152
00:13:49.119 --> 00:13:52.498
<i>Is it still not enough?</i>

153
00:13:53.457 --> 00:13:56.460
<i>How strong do I have to be</i>

154
00:13:57.836 --> 00:14:01.507
<i>to escape this life of constant ridicule?!</i>

155
00:14:06.262 --> 00:14:08.180
<i>The Weakest Hunter of All Mankind.</i>

156
00:14:08.764 --> 00:14:11.600
Everyone has been calling you that lately.

157
00:14:11.684 --> 00:14:12.518
Yes.

158
00:14:12.601 --> 00:14:14.103
Damn it.

159
00:14:14.186 --> 00:14:16.564
There are always people
who speak childishly.

160
00:14:17.481 --> 00:14:20.442
Work hard and make them change their mind.

161
00:14:21.944 --> 00:14:23.988
Yes.

162
00:14:24.071 --> 00:14:25.114
I understand.

163
00:14:42.756 --> 00:14:45.384
{\an8}They gave me that nickname
because I was too weak.

164
00:14:46.385 --> 00:14:48.762
{\an8}I was looked down upon
because I was too weak.

165
00:14:51.223 --> 00:14:53.434
I also felt useless.

166
00:14:54.768 --> 00:14:56.186
As long as I'm strong enough...

167
00:14:58.147 --> 00:15:01.567
<i>One with overwhelming power
can naturally remain undefeated.</i>

168
00:15:02.192 --> 00:15:04.862
<i>The weak are powerless before the strong.</i>

169
00:15:04.945 --> 00:15:08.574
<i>The weak can only stand still.
trembling in fear.</i>

170
00:15:09.158 --> 00:15:10.826
<i>People are looked down upon
because they are weak.</i>

171
00:15:11.410 --> 00:15:15.581
<i>Even if they're knowledgeable.
smart. or considerate.</i>

172
00:15:16.248 --> 00:15:18.083
<i>before the strong.</i>

173
00:15:19.168 --> 00:15:21.128
{\an8}they will be betrayed.

174
00:15:22.087 --> 00:15:23.547
Gentleness is meaningless.

175
00:15:23.631 --> 00:15:24.965
So I must become stronger.

176
00:15:25.049 --> 00:15:27.092
That's why I came here!

177
00:15:41.440 --> 00:15:42.524
I...

178
00:15:47.988 --> 00:15:50.866
I must become stronger.

179
00:15:57.247 --> 00:15:58.082
<i>Not enough.</i>

180
00:15:59.500 --> 00:16:01.377
{\an8}Compared to that thing.

181
00:16:01.460 --> 00:16:03.420
{\an8}<i>compared to the fear back then.</i>

182
00:16:04.421 --> 00:16:06.298
you have nothing to make me afraid!

183
00:16:20.854 --> 00:16:23.857
{\an8}<i>I've put all my ability points
into strength.</i>

184
00:16:29.279 --> 00:16:30.531
<i>With my current self...</i>

185
00:16:34.785 --> 00:16:36.745
{\an8}With my current self...

186
00:16:38.288 --> 00:16:41.583
I'm going to kill you!

187
00:16:43.877 --> 00:16:47.589
Die!

188
00:17:18.370 --> 00:17:20.539
It seems

189
00:17:20.622 --> 00:17:23.042
I should have gotten a bit stronger.

190
00:17:32.051 --> 00:17:34.928
Thanks to that. I got good stuff.

191
00:17:35.763 --> 00:17:38.766
This dagger isn't made from bone
but from teeth?

192
00:17:40.476 --> 00:17:43.062
Its power is twice that
of Mr. Kim's sword.

193
00:17:43.145 --> 00:17:45.522
and it comes with paralysis
and bleeding effects.

194
00:17:46.106 --> 00:17:47.900
By comparison.

195
00:17:47.983 --> 00:17:49.943
this thing is too terrifying to use.

196
00:17:50.027 --> 00:17:51.737
Anyway. I'll collect it for now.

197
00:18:01.163 --> 00:18:02.748
Is it over?

198
00:18:14.093 --> 00:18:15.302
Not a person in sight.

199
00:18:15.385 --> 00:18:16.512
What time is it?

200
00:18:17.137 --> 00:18:18.430
Hey!

201
00:18:18.514 --> 00:18:19.932
How can you just walk in here?

202
00:18:20.599 --> 00:18:22.643
Didn't you hear the announcement?

203
00:18:22.726 --> 00:18:23.811
Announcement?

204
00:18:23.894 --> 00:18:25.437
Don't play dumb with me...

205
00:18:26.605 --> 00:18:28.482
Are you a hunter?

206
00:18:28.565 --> 00:18:30.734
Yes. I am a hunter.

207
00:18:30.818 --> 00:18:32.236
Sorry for being rude.

208
00:18:32.319 --> 00:18:33.821
I'll take you to the site.

209
00:18:33.904 --> 00:18:34.780
This way. please.

210
00:18:34.863 --> 00:18:35.781
Ah. okay.

211
00:18:36.907 --> 00:18:38.575
<i>Has something happened?</i>

212
00:18:44.164 --> 00:18:45.666
Dungeon Break.

213
00:18:45.749 --> 00:18:48.252
Did magic beasts get out?

214
00:18:48.335 --> 00:18:50.921
Almost all of them have been killed.

215
00:18:51.004 --> 00:18:53.549
Only a giant magic beast has been left.

216
00:18:53.632 --> 00:18:56.093
<i>I don't know if it's because
my perception has improved.</i>

217
00:18:57.094 --> 00:18:58.137
<i>I can feel it.</i>

218
00:18:58.971 --> 00:19:00.556
<i>That thing over there is the boss.</i>

219
00:19:06.478 --> 00:19:08.188
Please do not take photos.

220
00:19:08.689 --> 00:19:09.940
This place is very dangerous.

221
00:19:11.942 --> 00:19:13.152
Kill it quickly.

222
00:19:13.735 --> 00:19:15.821
What if the land prices here drop?

223
00:19:16.321 --> 00:19:17.823
All healers!

224
00:19:17.906 --> 00:19:20.242
Please focus on healing the tanker!

225
00:19:20.325 --> 00:19:22.119
I don't need you to tell me!

226
00:19:24.496 --> 00:19:26.665
What are the fighters doing?

227
00:19:26.748 --> 00:19:29.334
Why is it not weakening at all?

228
00:19:30.085 --> 00:19:32.921
Its defense is just too strong.

229
00:19:33.005 --> 00:19:35.424
We have few mages among us.

230
00:19:35.507 --> 00:19:37.176
Excuse me. let us through!

231
00:19:37.718 --> 00:19:39.303
<i>Is it because it's a temporary team?</i>

232
00:19:39.386 --> 00:19:40.554
<i>They don't work well together.</i>

233
00:19:42.514 --> 00:19:43.932
<i>Their ranks are too low.</i>

234
00:19:44.516 --> 00:19:48.270
<i>It should be eight E-rank hunters
and one D-rank hunter.</i>

235
00:19:48.937 --> 00:19:50.564
<i>And because that tanker is D-rank.</i>

236
00:19:50.647 --> 00:19:53.150
<i>it became a prolonged battle
as no one could deliver a fatal blow.</i>

237
00:19:54.067 --> 00:19:57.112
<i>As for the healers. are they
two D-rank healers and one B-rank healer?</i>

238
00:19:58.322 --> 00:19:59.489
Hey. Miss!

239
00:19:59.573 --> 00:20:01.533
Hurry up and heal them!

240
00:20:01.617 --> 00:20:03.327
Aren't you a B-rank healer?

241
00:20:03.911 --> 00:20:05.370
What are you dazed about?

242
00:20:05.454 --> 00:20:06.622
Yes.

243
00:20:09.208 --> 00:20:11.585
Damn it. pull yourself together.

244
00:20:16.882 --> 00:20:20.344
<i>She still hasn't gotten over it
after a week?</i>

245
00:20:21.220 --> 00:20:22.262
<i>It's no surprise.</i>

246
00:20:23.388 --> 00:20:24.223
<i>After all. I also...</i>

247
00:20:25.807 --> 00:20:26.642
<i>No.</i>

248
00:20:29.895 --> 00:20:31.063
<i>This is a D-rank boss.</i>

249
00:20:32.731 --> 00:20:35.234
<i>It's weaker than the one I just defeated.</i>

250
00:20:36.443 --> 00:20:38.779
We'll get wiped out if this continues!

251
00:20:38.862 --> 00:20:40.739
We can't defeat it
without a high-rank hunter!

252
00:20:41.323 --> 00:20:43.450
<i>As long as I can break its defense.</i>

253
00:20:44.284 --> 00:20:45.118
<i>I can defeat it!</i>

254
00:20:49.790 --> 00:20:51.792
<i>I'll give it the most powerful hit.</i>

255
00:20:52.876 --> 00:20:53.794
Take this!

256
00:20:56.421 --> 00:20:58.423
Good. its defense is broken.

257
00:20:58.507 --> 00:20:59.341
We can defeat it.

258
00:21:08.058 --> 00:21:08.892
We did it.

259
00:21:08.976 --> 00:21:10.686
We defeated it!

260
00:21:11.979 --> 00:21:14.273
<i>All attacks were ineffective against it.</i>

261
00:21:14.356 --> 00:21:16.525
<i>Why were we able to break its defense?</i>

262
00:21:16.608 --> 00:21:19.861
<i>Our attacks had no effect.</i>

263
00:21:20.904 --> 00:21:22.614
<i>It was something that flew over...</i>

264
00:21:24.700 --> 00:21:29.204
<i>A Boss Golem that remained unscathed
under the attack of a dozen hunters</i>

265
00:21:29.288 --> 00:21:30.998
<i>was defeated by this thing?</i>

266
00:21:32.833 --> 00:21:34.668
- Sorry.
- Yes.

267
00:21:35.252 --> 00:21:37.629
Who threw this?

268
00:21:37.713 --> 00:21:39.840
Oh. it was the hunter over there...

269
00:21:40.674 --> 00:21:41.717
Huh?

270
00:21:41.800 --> 00:21:44.261
- He was just here.
<i>- Such terrifying destructive power.</i>

271
00:21:45.637 --> 00:21:47.514
<i>Is he a high-rank hunter?</i>

272
00:21:54.980 --> 00:21:56.982
I didn't expect to take it down
with a single strike.

273
00:21:57.482 --> 00:22:00.569
Perhaps that Golem
was running out of vitality anyway.

274
00:22:05.282 --> 00:22:06.908
Jinwoo...
